  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "For the fixed cost f_k of using marshaling station k, is it charged once if any positive quantity is transshipped through that station (i.e., a fixed charge that makes the problem a fixed-charge transportation problem), or is it simply a per-unit cost that should be added to the unit transportation costs?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the nature of the cost (fixed vs. per-unit), which constitutes one semantically independent question."
}

